    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 0
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "In the lightless expanse of the Mana Abyss, a fractured spark of consciousness drifts alone\u2014stripped of name, stripped of flesh, stripped of time."
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: -1209473274661334273, guid: d967d5ae126ccc744b54a1a313dbbcfd, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 0
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "From the surrounding dark, scattered incandescent shards\u2014fragments of instinct, logic, and an unyielding vow\u2014begin to drift inward."
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 7858946771831737424, guid: 8a3cd8230b9c4924e91948574e6c9528, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 0
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (A faint, resonant ripple binds the drifting core... like a distant hand steadying yours before the dark closes in.)
    captionSpeaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: -7684088050009103717, guid: 458fc9b0a7e8587499254d87040f2389, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 0
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Mana surges around the mended core, pulling it downward from the astral void toward cold, ancient stone.
    captionSpeaker: 
